{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026OpHFqa4vLn1794954525.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國收緊人工智能(AI)晶片使用限制後，據報涉及字節跳動的一筆4.8億美元貸款受到嚴重影響。《彭博》報道，這筆貸款原計劃用於購買輝達Nvidia晶片，並提供予字節跳動使用。</p><p></p><p>總部位於新加坡的新雲端服務商Aolani Cloud，最近開始邀請銀行參與貸款，用於購買輝達的圖形處理器，部署用於馬來西亞的數據中心，但自美國星期一發布人工智能晶片使用新規後，已有五家銀行表示，考慮到可能違反美國新規，已在內部討論退出或不參與貸款。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T23:42:35.973609+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T22:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T03:57:14.233250+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T23:35:49.204712+00:00","content_hash":"34f7a43a6e865f0397014e31d202ac0ed0559f0a602564a8052b1452ea874089","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T23:42:35.973609+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}